OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy periods with showers
OL,6,Fduring the morning. Sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping in places during the
OL,8,Fafternoon but further showers are
OL,9,Flikely. A windy day, especially along
OL,10,Fthe coast. Temperatures around average
OL,11,Ffor the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable amounts of cloud
OL,14,Fovernight with some clear spells,
OL,15,Fespecially inland. Further showers are
OL,16,Flikely, though these may become
OL,17,Flargely confined to the coast after
OL,18,Fmidnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
