OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloud increasing through the
OL,6,Fmorning with further, mainly light,
OL,7,Fshowers. Some brighter spells may
OL,8,Fdevelop through the afternoon with
OL,9,Fshowers becoming isolated. Breezy,
OL,10,Fespecially near the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,14,Fcoming days, bringing largely cloudy
OL,15,Fconditions with isolated showers, and
OL,16,Fan easterly breeze. Temperatures
OL,17,Fremain around normal for the time of
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
